    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Candidate dataset: Metamath Proof Explorer";
    dc:description "public examples of formal axiom systems and derivations";
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://us.metamath.org/mpeuni/mmset.html>.
<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/wolfram2002-ch12-33--gpt--analysis-feasibility> a <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/LLMClaimAssessment>;
